      "jobId": "40cbcc37-2358-4b98-819a-d15f87abcdbc",
      "prompt": "A single flat-sided hexagonal diorama tile, 32 m across, lush meadow grass cap and the hexagon side walls show a thin grass lip over dark root-filled topsoil that darkens softly downward into a near-black foot, one continuous dark earth, laid out as a small farmyard. About half the tile is a field of neat parallel ploughed furrows of dark brown earth beside a few rows of young green crops. The other half holds a red-painted vertical-board timber barn with a steep dark slate roof and large double doors, a packed-earth yard with a few round hay bales and a small stack of rectangular hay bales, and a grassy paddock enclosed by a weathered post-and-rail timber fence, stylized-real diorama miniature, real PBR materials, slightly exaggerated proportions, soft noon sun, neutral grey studio background, 35 degree three-quarter view"
